Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How's your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lots of laundry, huh?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[murmuring]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[murmuring]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave your husband already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can have this anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Olan? At the altar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,where is the way to\Nthe top of the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's at the end of the crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,On the left, there is a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,On the right, at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are wild again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me\Nto poke them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just appreciating...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The beautiful nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Zak,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is Jaz, my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, love. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I had something\Nto take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Your towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come close,\NI'll wipe your sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You removed your towel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to\Nremove your towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.71,0:13:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need therapy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can walk\Nand move by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we continue the massage\NMang Karyo does to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What we need to do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is find a therapist for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A professional,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what the doctor said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just giving\NMang Karyo a small fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is happening\Nwith his massages on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s temporarily pawn this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't always be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We will figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to sleep, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the right way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,towards the top of the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.55,0:20:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's at the end of the crossroads,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going up alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s hard to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not with anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You might get lost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a signage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,directing to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, there\Nwas signage before,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while\Nsince I went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But just follow that narrow path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No. It's an energy bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I usually eat\Nwhen I suddenly get hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when I'm at the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I go to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re carrying a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to spend\Nthe night there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead.\NI think I'm interrupting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.\NI'm already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.22,0:21:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Jayron.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go?\N- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,your next path is to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.21,0:22:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.83,0:22:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come.\N- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.29,0:22:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Which part?\N- There, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.25,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here?\N- Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.01,0:22:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.22,0:23:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- This?\N- Yes! That's it! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.43,0:23:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.14,0:23:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, let me take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No need, I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone might see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who? No one is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.35,0:23:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.89,0:23:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.67,0:23:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With that handsome face of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.36,0:23:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.01,0:23:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't had a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I did have a girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t done it\Nwith any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.04,0:23:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because for me, I’ll do it only
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,when I’m ready to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.07,0:23:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the other town.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.51,0:27:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a job there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So that you won't get thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.29,0:28:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tease me, Olan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.37,0:28:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably thought I didn’t\Nknow what you’re doing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.69,0:28:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you're always here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd like me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.32,0:28:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to tell your husband\Nwhat you've been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got nothing else to do here\Nbut do laundry, and fetch water!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.61,0:28:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was the person\NI saw the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.75,0:28:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He just asked me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.91,0:28:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you want me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.38,0:28:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to go to your husband instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.00,0:28:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.72,0:29:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Dolores?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.93,0:29:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.67,0:29:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be able\Nto control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.47,0:29:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll come to you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.38,0:29:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.06,0:30:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our savings are running low.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.01,0:30:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept more laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.23,0:30:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.18,0:30:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.79,0:30:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.05,0:30:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolores!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.58,0:30:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah, hi!\N- How did you find my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.02,0:30:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you returned to Manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:31:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on vacation for\Na few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.87,0:31:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I also rented a\Nsmall room in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Up for getting lost again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.31,0:31:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept thinking of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,guess that’s why I got lost again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.79,0:31:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to court you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.17,0:31:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.94,0:31:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone beat you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.31,0:31:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.45,0:31:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You already have a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.54,0:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.36,0:31:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.61,0:31:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he got into an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell off a tree,\Nthat's why he can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.66,0:31:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a PT.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.93,0:31:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Physical Therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.91,0:31:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.19,0:31:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.56,0:31:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.44,0:32:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.79,0:32:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.41,0:32:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Jayron.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.77,0:32:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.80,0:32:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Rodel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.42,0:32:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a physical therapist from Manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.90,0:32:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I met Dolores at the--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.06,0:32:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The village.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.95,0:32:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him talking to the\Ncommunity watchman
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.51,0:32:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,at the village when he went\Nup the mountain last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.39,0:32:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I overheard that he was a PT,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.91,0:32:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.12,0:32:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked if he can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.56,0:32:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I do community work\Nfrom time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.86,0:32:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I help those who need therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.61,0:32:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.84,0:32:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your bag down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.52,0:32:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.23,0:33:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When did your accident happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.02,0:33:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost six months already.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.93,0:33:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have hypertension.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.93,0:33:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.10,0:33:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell from the tree in the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.76,0:33:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have kept\Nthe prescription,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,medication, or any documents
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.42,0:33:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,given by the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.80,0:33:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.01,0:33:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.50,0:33:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower limb trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.10,0:33:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hips and thighs\Nare fractured.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.47,0:33:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you were given\Na prescription for the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.45,0:33:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you continue the medication?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.16,0:33:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed everything\Nthe doctor told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.60,0:34:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I haven't\Ndone is the therapy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.96,0:34:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,because we don't\Nhave enough budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.87,0:34:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do the therapy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.31,0:34:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any\Nmoney to pay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.63,0:34:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.80,0:34:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to check it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.93,0:34:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.20,0:34:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I advise that you have\Nsomething to hold on to,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.47,0:34:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,like parallel bars or some wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.95,0:34:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Would bamboo be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.78,0:35:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, anything that\Nyou can hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.32,0:35:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolores!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.45,0:35:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of bamboo\Nin our backyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.15,0:35:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have one built.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.51,0:35:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.69,0:35:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.15,0:35:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.43,0:35:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.86,0:35:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.47,0:35:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.90,0:35:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Rodel?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.37,0:35:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going up\Nthe mountain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.85,0:35:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.69,0:35:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.23,0:35:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I already cooked our food\Nfor the whole day this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And he can move, just slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.83,0:35:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back down\Nafter I drop you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Will your husband\Nbe okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.37,0:35:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.82,0:35:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.21,0:38:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.80,0:38:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.89,0:38:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.96,0:38:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can stay,\Nbut I know you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.87,0:38:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I can\Ngo back at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.68,0:38:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.52,0:38:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head down tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.11,0:38:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Rodel?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.47,0:38:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.16,0:38:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.26,0:39:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell him you came\Nwith me as a tour guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.32,0:39:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.72,0:39:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.00,0:39:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t turn this down
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.29,0:39:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,because I really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.95,0:39:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you also\Nfor coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.84,0:39:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you’re used\Nto climbing mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.15,0:39:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've climbed a lot of mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.66,0:39:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you used to\Nmaking girls fall for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.29,0:39:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.54,0:39:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s always me\Nwho ends up alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.46,0:39:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you just give in?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.13,0:39:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s because my\Nparents are religious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.25,0:39:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.48,0:39:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No this, no that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.85,0:39:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I grew up being told not to sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.99,0:39:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.57,0:39:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve become a sinner\Nbecause you’re into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.98,0:39:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And especially me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.51,0:39:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,because I gave in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.29,0:40:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing Rodel made me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.65,0:40:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I started questioning\Nwhat I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.66,0:40:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should I do?\NI also have desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Beauty comes with price.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.46,0:40:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.09,0:40:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.23,0:40:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me experience\Nthe most passionate sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.46,0:40:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.60,0:40:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.72,0:40:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.67,0:40:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. I can't get excited--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.96,0:40:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.22,0:40:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.69,0:40:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I only feel free\Nwhen I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.84,0:40:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me forget\Nall my problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.70,0:40:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,even if just for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.08,0:40:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s enjoy this little\Nforbidden escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.41,0:46:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.58,0:46:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jayron asked me to be his\Ntour guide to the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.85,0:46:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He even paid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.92,0:46:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He also told me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.78,0:46:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come back every Saturday\Nand Sunday for your therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.28,0:46:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.95,0:47:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! That hurts, doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.86,0:47:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.39,0:47:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.85,0:47:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be gentle!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.06,0:47:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.93,0:47:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking all the pleasure\Nyou want, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.09,0:47:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking nonsense again, Olan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.67,0:47:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve totally lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.93,0:47:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If Rodel saw this…\NYou think he’d be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.66,0:48:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Delete it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.19,0:48:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's crazy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.37,0:48:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.75,0:48:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time a tourist\Ngets lost in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.28,0:48:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you always give them\Na different route.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.75,0:48:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A route
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.94,0:48:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,straight to your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.74,0:48:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m begging you, Olan.\NPlease, delete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.27,0:48:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,On one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.58,0:48:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You know exactly what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.57,0:48:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.58,0:48:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.97,0:48:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.12,0:50:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry it up, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.63,0:50:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, you delete that!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.28,0:50:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm stupid like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.93,0:51:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I delete it if I’m\Ngetting something out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.77,0:51:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.25,0:51:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.93,0:51:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what\NI’m about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.34,0:51:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.99,0:51:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll be my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.44,0:51:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.80,0:51:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it getting hard for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.37,0:51:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the one working for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.12,0:52:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't satisfy your\Nneeds anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.18,0:52:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.74,0:52:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re overthinking everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.31,0:52:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.02,0:52:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, a little more.\N- Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.96,0:52:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.61,0:52:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.70,0:52:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.19,0:52:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.29,0:52:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.46,0:52:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing good!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.23,0:52:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here.\N- Thank you so much, Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.19,0:52:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you just need\Na little more therapy,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.72,0:52:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon you'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.35,0:53:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.71,0:53:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cook a nice meal, Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.31,0:53:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us for dinner, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.87,0:53:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just Jayron,\Nand I’m not a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.72,0:53:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.89,0:53:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're helping me heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.77,0:53:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay for the night, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.46,0:53:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting late already.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.54,0:53:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.57,0:53:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a patient\Ntomorrow at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.81,0:53:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For therapy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.51,0:53:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you go home then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.48,0:53:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.05,0:53:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I parked it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.29,0:53:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also thinking that
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.97,0:53:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I might get home late.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.16,0:53:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.69,0:53:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Before,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.02,0:53:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you used to come\Nin the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.95,0:53:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I even told Dolores,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.81,0:53:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you won’t make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.27,0:53:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I had to see a\Npatient at their house,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.14,0:53:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm a bit late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.82,0:53:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.28,0:53:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.69,0:54:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.91,0:54:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.52,0:54:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.86,0:54:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.97,0:54:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When I
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,can walk and move\Naround properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.08,0:54:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,will my little one\Nalso get better?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.85,0:54:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Rodel, stop it.\N- Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.87,0:54:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it hasn't stood up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.24,0:54:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That condition really\Ndoes affect sexual function.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.33,0:54:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you’re\Nstill feeling pain
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.69,0:54:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and haven’t fully healed,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.48,0:54:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,it can affect your sexual life
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.41,0:54:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,because some nerves\Naren’t functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.33,0:54:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether erectile dysfunction\Nwill go away and if it will return,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.04,0:54:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,only a doctor can say, but
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.06,0:54:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it will work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.25,0:54:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Dolores?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.32,0:54:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.75,0:55:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.97,0:55:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.31,0:55:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,if you really have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.40,0:55:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.21,0:55:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I’ll rest as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.93,0:55:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.37,0:55:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.86,0:55:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can get the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.75,0:55:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.35,0:55:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.55,0:56:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank for helping me and Rodel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.48,0:56:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't get tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.54,0:56:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get tired as long\Nas you want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.17,0:56:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.81,0:56:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your love is enough
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.19,0:56:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and seeing you everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.41,0:56:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really need to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.38,0:56:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go back to Manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.79,0:56:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Rodel?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.36,0:56:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.97,0:56:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's already asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.31,1:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful when\Ntaking your regular walks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.47,1:03:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to give you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.57,1:03:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.09,1:03:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be expensive, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.80,1:03:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no. Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.83,1:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.29,1:03:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.67,1:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend who is a\Nsupplier gave me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.75,1:03:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sample
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.11,1:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to recommend to patients who\Nare having a hard time walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.10,1:04:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,These medicines
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.43,1:04:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,are from my friend\Nthat's a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.70,1:04:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and these are his prescriptions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.46,1:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We already owe you so much, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.62,1:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.77,1:04:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s important is\Nthat you get better.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.89,1:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I’ll go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.97,1:04:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Rodel, I'll just walk him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.65,1:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.08,1:04:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.36,1:04:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.41,1:04:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.12,1:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.55,1:05:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there tourists\Ncamping here too?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, during the holidays,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.25,1:05:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but not a lot of\Ntourists these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.95,1:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.97,1:05:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.77,1:05:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Rodel fully recovers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.93,1:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be better\Nso that he can work.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.24,1:05:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he is fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.11,1:05:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How about us?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.42,1:05:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Us? What do you mean, us?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.03,1:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.72,1:05:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your husband is better,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.28,1:05:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,will this go on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.18,1:06:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.94,1:06:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You really love him so much?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.78,1:06:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.55,1:06:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught him cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.06,1:06:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I confronted them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.32,1:06:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He came back to his senses.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.29,1:06:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe the proverb is true.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.01,1:06:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That no matter how\Nmuch you avoid it,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.40,1:06:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,someone will still come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.48,1:06:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.26,1:06:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.81,1:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.64,1:06:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you have tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.08,1:06:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.00,1:06:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.07,1:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This, and here on my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Also this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.01,1:06:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My piercings?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.82,1:06:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my foolishness\Nwith my first boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.33,1:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He really likes tattoos\Nand piercings.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.06,1:07:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.71,1:07:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.88,1:07:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.26,1:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are something.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.29,1:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your new guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.67,1:07:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want your\Nhusband anymore?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.83,1:07:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're causing trouble even here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.99,1:07:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t like being\Nbothered, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.02,1:07:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.66,1:07:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Making you moan?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.00,1:07:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already, Olan!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.18,1:07:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, here in the woods?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.07,1:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You really do it here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.35,1:07:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, man.\NMaybe you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.55,1:07:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not from here,\Nso don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.07,1:07:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't meddle in my life
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.88,1:07:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and my married life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.20,1:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really defending that doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.76,1:07:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.30,1:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it already.\N- Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.01,1:08:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You used to be\Nthe one courting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.00,1:08:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.89,1:08:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t know what you’re saying—
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.17,1:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re just drunk!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.47,1:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.04,1:08:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.76,1:08:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.30,1:08:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.30,1:08:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.79,1:08:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to show your man\Nwhat you’ve been doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.00,1:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re going crazy, Olan!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.03,1:08:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re losing it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.43,1:08:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been crazy about you\Nfor a long time, Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.56,1:08:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.40,1:08:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.13,1:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I really want...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.06,1:09:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is for your man to watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.96,1:09:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm making you feel good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.91,1:09:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.07,1:09:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.02,1:09:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd rather we go to Rodel?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.69,1:09:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And all four of us\Nshare this moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.00,1:09:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.81,1:09:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Undress!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.86,1:09:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Move away!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.91,1:09:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.91,1:09:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.69,1:09:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Move away!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.48,1:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Undress!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.42,1:09:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.75,1:09:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.19,1:09:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get naked!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.90,1:10:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to shoot\Nyou in the head?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.05,1:10:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Undress! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.53,1:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I am! I am!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.46,1:10:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.12,1:10:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.15,1:10:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! I'm waiting!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.74,1:10:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie down!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.11,1:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.62,1:10:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jayron!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.30,1:10:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to join?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.95,1:10:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.23,1:10:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.36,1:10:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.93,1:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.20,1:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Olan!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.25,1:10:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.50,1:10:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.74,1:11:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to shoot\Nyou in the head?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.71,1:12:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Rodel!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.06,1:12:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rodel!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.23,1:12:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.50,1:12:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't stop you because
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.83,1:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you that much.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting that
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.55,1:12:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,we’d end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.34,1:12:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.43,1:12:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.49,1:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you had\Nsomething with Jayron for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.28,1:14:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.51,1:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I submitted my\Napplication to Canada.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.32,1:14:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I got approved.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.20,1:14:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go back to Manila to...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.60,1:14:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix my documents.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.94,1:14:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit that I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.03,1:14:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.28,1:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially you, Rodel.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.12,1:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.94,1:15:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.39,1:15:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.34,1:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,For everything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.62,1:15:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.45,1:15:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we forget everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.83,1:15:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.15,1:15:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When we carry so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.37,1:15:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever you may end up,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.11,1:15:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t forget about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.00,1:15:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For all of your help,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.57,1:15:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.68,1:16:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.16,1:16:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.13,1:16:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of Rodel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.15,1:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a really a good person.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.53,1:17:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really lucky\Nto have Rodel,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.72,1:17:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,who truly loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.77,1:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.48,1:17:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.71,1:17:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I love my husband more.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.32,1:17:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.19,1:17:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For the short time
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.74,1:17:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve known you,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.14,1:17:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.31,1:17:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever help I can give,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.76,1:18:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,just contact me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.99,1:18:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t forget you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.90,1:18:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Always take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.43,1:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Always remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.73,1:18:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a Jayron\Nwho courted you
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.00,1:18:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.25,1:18:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, even\Nthough I shouldn’t.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.28,1:18:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not lose our\Nway again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.59,1:19:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.29,1:19:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go inside and eat.
